[00:00.00] 作词 : Richard Wright
[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Richard Wright
[00:23.35]Would you like to say something before you leave
[00:23.35]在你离开之前你还想和我寒暄几句吗
[00:30.55]Perhaps you'd care to state exactly how you feel
[00:30.55]可能你想准确陈述你此刻的感受
[00:38.02]We said good-bye before we said hello
[00:38.02]在我们说你好之前已经说了再见
[00:45.26]I hardly even like you, I shouldn't care at all
[00:45.26]我再也无法像你一样自由 我一点也不在乎
[00:52.48]We met just six hours ago, the music was too loud
[00:52.48]六小时前我们才邂逅相识 音乐声震耳欲聋
[01:00.10]From your bed I gained a day and lost a bloody year
[01:00.10]在你床上我收获了美妙的一天 却痛失整整一年
[01:07.33]And I would like to know
[01:07.33]我想一探究竟的是
[01:13.50]How do you feel, how do you feel, how do you feel?
[01:13.50]对此你作何感想 你作何感想 你作何感想呢？
[01:47.55]
[02:08.87]Not a single word was said, delights still without fears
[02:08.87]但你不发一言 神采飞扬毫无惧色
[02:16.09]Occasionally you showed a smile but what was the need
[02:16.09]偶尔强颜挤出一个微笑
[02:23.33]I felt the cold far too soon - the wind of '95
[02:23.33]心头早就掠过一丝战栗 那是95年吹拂的风
[02:32.95]My friends are lying in the sun, I wish that I was there
[02:32.95]我的朋友们躺在太阳下 我希望我也在他们中间
[02:40.20]Tomorrow brings another town and another girl like you
[02:40.20]明天城镇改头换面 身边的女孩仍然像你
[02:47.57]Have you time before you leave to greet another man
[02:47.57]在你离开和别的男人搭讪之前可否和我再聊一聊
[02:54.80]Just you let me know
[02:54.80]只要让我一探究竟
[03:00.72]How do you feel, how do you feel, how do you feel?
[03:00.72]对此你作何感想 你作何感想 你作何感想呢？
[03:59.99]Good-bye to you
[03:59.99]再见吧
[04:04.63]Charlotte Kringles too
[04:04.63]再见吧 夏洛特·柯林斯
[04:09.37]I've had enough for one day
[04:09.37]终有一天我会拥有一切
